<pre id="start" class="body">
The latest prerelease of Arena -- W3O's testbed HTML3 browser --
includes an experimental style sheet scheme. Using the proposed HTML3
&lt;STYLE&gt; tag, users and authors can set presentation preferences. The
current implementation is severely restricted, but shows
potential. Comments are welcome.

<a href="http://www.w3.org/hypertext/WWW/Arena/">http://www.w3.org/hypertext/WWW/Arena/</a>

-h&amp;kon

Hakon W Lie, WWW project CERN, CH-1211 Geneva 23
<a href="http://www.w3.org/hypertext/WWW/People/howcome/">http://www.w3.org/hypertext/WWW/People/howcome/</a>
</pre>
